<title>USA: Encinitas, Calif., golf bonds yld 7.75 pct in 2026.</title>
<headline>Encinitas, Calif., golf bonds yld 7.75 pct in 2026.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stone &amp; Youngberg said Thursday it priced Encinitas Ranch Golf Authority, Calif., revenue bonds with a 7.75 percent coupon at par to yield 7.75 percent in the sole 2026 maturity.</p>
<p>The bonds are not rated, and are callabe on 9/1/2006 at 102, declining to par on 9/1/2008. Delivery is firm for 9/24/1996.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
